.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# M0-06 tiles: generated seed + Planetiler working data.
# Only .gitkeep + the tileserver config.json under infra/tiles/ are tracked.
infra/tiles/*.mbtiles
infra/tiles/*.pbf
infra/tiles/sources/
infra/tiles/tmp/
infra/tiles/*.tsv.gz
!infra/tiles/.gitkeep

# Auth ES256 signing key material — the dev keypair is generated by `make auth-keys` (M2-13,
# which owns generation + compose mount) into infra/auth-keys/ and must never be committed.
infra/auth-keys/

# Provider API keys (M4-10). `make up` creates infra/secrets/gemini.key empty; the user pastes the
# key into it. Never committed, never baked into an image.
infra/secrets/
